  "annotations": [
   {
    "id": "a1",
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "**Aerodynamics.** RotorAero: tip-speed ratio lambda = Omega R / v_rel with v_rel = v - xdot (the nacelle's velocity gives the aerodynamic damping of the tower), the BEM tables Cp(lambda, beta) and Ct(lambda, beta) (two Lookup2D, from the report's blade and airfoil data, design/bem.py), the torque Ta = 1/2 rho pi R^2 Cp v^3 / Omega and the thrust T = 1/2 rho pi R^2 Ct v^2.",
    "x": 520,
    "y": -60,
    "w": 520,
    "h": 90,
    "color": "blue"
   },
   {
    "id": "a2",
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "**Drivetrain (rotation).** Rotor 1-junction: rotor inertia and aerodynamic torque. Shaft 0-junction: the shaft torque; its twist rate (Twist 1-junction) loads the shaft's C (1/k) and R (c), both low-speed-shaft equivalents. Gearbox TF 97. Gen 1-junction: generator inertia and the generator (an MSe absorbing the converter's torque).",
    "x": 560,
    "y": 760,
    "w": 620,
    "h": 70,
    "color": "blue"
   },
   {
    "id": "a3",
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "**Tower (translation).** The first fore-aft mode as one degree of freedom, the tower-top deflection: modal mass, stiffness and 1 % damping from a finite-element model of the report's tower with the rotor and nacelle on top (design/tower.py, 0.322 Hz). The thrust drives it; its velocity feeds back into the wind the rotor sees.",
    "x": 520,
    "y": 1140,
    "w": 520,
    "h": 70,
    "color": "blue"
   },
   {
    "id": "a4",
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "**Generator.** The converter (RateLimitedLag: a 50 ms lag and the report's 15 kN m/s torque-rate limit) sets the generator torque. ElecPower = eta_gen x torque x speed, in MW.",
    "x": 1700,
    "y": 600,
    "w": 420,
    "h": 60,
    "color": "blue"
   },
   {
    "id": "a5",
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "**Baseline controller** (report chapter 7). SpeedFilter: the generator speed through a 0.25 Hz low-pass. Torque (VSTorque): regions 1.5, 2 (k2 w^2, 0.0255764 N m/rpm^2), 2.5 and 3 (constant power). PitchCtrl (PitchPI): the collective-pitch PI to 1173.7 rpm, gain-scheduled by 1/(1 + beta/6.3 deg). PitchAct: the pitch actuator, 8 deg/s.",
    "x": 1740,
    "y": -60,
    "w": 560,
    "h": 90,
    "color": "blue"
   },
   {
    "id": "a6",
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "**Wind.** A slow ramp from v_start to v_end: the turbine follows its quasi-steady power curve.",
    "x": 40,
    "y": 20,
    "w": 300,
    "h": 60,
    "color": "green"
   }
  ]
 },
